sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Main
    participant Sim as MessageOrderingSimulator
    participant P1 as SimProcess P1
    participant P2 as SimProcess P2
    User->>Main: Send P1 -> P2 "Hello"
    Main->>Sim: send(P1, P2, "Hello")
    Sim->>P1: tick()
    P1-->>Sim: logical timestamp 1
    Sim->>Sim: create M1 and log SEND
    Sim-->>Main: Message M1
    User->>Main: Deliver M1
    Main->>Sim: deliver(M1, FIFO on)
    Sim->>Sim: FIFO channel check
    Sim->>P2: receiveTick(1)
    P2-->>Sim: logical timestamp 2
    Sim->>Sim: log RECEIVE, delivery #1
    Sim-->>Main: delivered
